SUMMARY:The Sonoma County Fair
DESCRIPTION:A celebration of community spirit\, agriculture\, entertainment\, and wholesome fun. \n  \nThe Sonoma County Fair is an annual event that captivates visitors with its vibrant atmosphere and diverse offerings. Held in scenic Sonoma County\, California\, this fair is a celebration of community spirit\, agriculture\, entertainment\, and wholesome fun. From thrilling amusement rides and live music performances to engaging exhibits showcasing local produce\, crafts\, and artwork\, the fair offers something for everyone. Attendees can indulge in mouthwatering fair food\, participate in thrilling competitions\, enjoy live animal exhibits\, and explore the region’s rich agricultural heritage. With its charming blend of entertainment and education\, the Sonoma County Fair is a must-visit destination that brings joy and excitement to people of all ages.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-sonoma-county-fair-10/
LOCATION:Sonoma County Fairgrounds\, 1350 Bennett Valley Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Kids and Family,Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Sonoma-County-Fair.png
END:VEVENT
