SUMMARY:Cotati Accordion Festival
DESCRIPTION:Two day international\, multicultural\, multi-generational non profit accordion festival with 90 vendors\, five stages\, 35 acts with food\, wine and beer. The festival features the Zydeco Dance Party both days\, the dancing in the 40′ x 60′ Polka tent\, the Jam tent\, the Apocalypse Stage for the alternative experience\, and the two main stages featuring bands and soloists both local and from around the world.\nThere is free parking and a free shuttle. Kids 15 and under are free when accompanied by an adult. In between acts the family can enjoy the large playground\, the PSHS Wildlife Exhibit\, face painting and possibly the return of the Sonoma County Children’s Museum.\nThe musical genres flow through conjunto\, Cumbia\, jazz\, rock\, western\, Balkan\, classical\, Klezmer\, and even the United States Air Force band.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/cotati-accordion-festival/
LOCATION:Cotati Hub\, La Plaza Park\, Old Redwood Hwy & W Sierra Ave\, Cotati\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Kids and Family,Music
END:VEVENT
