SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Irish at The Bluewater Lounge in Bodega Bay!
DESCRIPTION:Live music\, delicious food\, and ocean views on the Sonoma Coast. \nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH (Suzuki Cady & Jimmy Murphy) play lovely\, lively traditional Irish tunes and sing soulful songs from a variety of genres on fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, and bodhrán. \n“A new\, local band is rocking the Bay Area—to high acclaim…They are commensurate acoustic musicians with decades of experience between them.” – Mark Fernquest\, Sebastopol Times \nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH: suzukicady.com/hardly-strictly-irish\nVIDEOS: suzukicady.com/videos\nSHOWS: suzukicady.com/events\nPRESS: suzukicady.com/press
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/hardly-strictly-irish-at-the-bluewater-lounge-in-bodega-bay/
LOCATION:Bluewater Lounge\, 21301 Heron Dr\, Bodega Bay\, CA\, 94923\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
