SUMMARY:Broadway Under the Stars - Mamma Mia!
DESCRIPTION:The global smash hit is coming to Sonoma for the very first time! Set on a sun-drenched Greek island\, Mamma Mia! follows a young bride-to-be on a quest to discover the identity of her father — bringing three very unexpected guests from her mother’s past back into their lives. Fueled by ABBA’s greatest hits (including “Dancing Queen\,” “Mamma Mia\,” “The Winner Takes It All\,” and more)\, this joyful tale of family\, friendship\, love\, and second chances has captured the hearts of millions worldwide. With its large cast\, explosive dance numbers\, nonstop humor\, and irresistible score\, Mamma Mia! promises to be one of the biggest and most unforgettable productions in Transcendence history.\nMamma Mia! is presented through special arrangement with Music Theatre International (MTI). All authorized performance materials are also supplied by MTI. www.mtishows.com
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/broadway-under-the-stars-mamma-mia-5/
LOCATION:Sonoma Valley Field of Dreams\, 151 1st Street West\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Theater
END:VEVENT
