SUMMARY:Country Crush featuring North Forty
DESCRIPTION:The newest addition to Dry Creek Vineyard’s Summer Concert Series brings a high-energy afternoon of country favorites and classic rock. Guests can learn to line dance\, then enjoy refreshing Chenin Blanc\, winery-exclusive Sauvignon Blancs and Zinfandels while relaxing on the lawn and savoring food from a local pop-up vendor.
